From 3264d616684a96231f3917aff6a8eeaa9d20109d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:51:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drip: 5 school days per week, Day numbers skip the weekend
 (Day 8 = next week)

Replaces the calendar-day rule. One exercise per school day (Mon-Fri),
counted from the registration day: Day 1 is immediate, then one per
school day at 00:00 Cambodia time. Day numbers are written in 7-day
weeks so Day 8 is next week and Day 30 fits a 1-month validity; the
weekend numbers 6-7, 13-14, 20-21, 27-28 are skipped for every student,
whatever weekday they register on.

- dripSchoolDayIndex(): Day number -> school day
- getDripUnlockMs(): steps over Mon-Fri only
- admin: Day 1-30 quick buttons (weekend numbers dimmed), Khmer hint
- tests: rewrite TEST 8 and TEST 9 (28/10 example, Day 30 inside the
  1-month validity, Firestore Timestamp shapes)
